    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 94,
      "id": "4705ec85b9ee75d0",
      "text": "[⌕ 放大 · 章引入](../../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%86%8C/%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1/04-01-%E7%AB%A0%E5%BC%95%E5%85%A5-eb468b.canvas)\n\n15 个展示原子 · 0 题",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 5896,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "f402eccb5523a1b5",
      "text": "[✦ 情景引入 · 由城市PM2.5监测数据建立统计预测模型](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 56,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "33656e8bd0f1b37c",
      "text": "[✦ 一、问题背景分析](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 476,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "f4abd141317f1813",
      "text": "[✦ 1. 绘制散点图](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 896,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "96c774a11463133f",
      "text": "[✦ 2. 建立线性回归方程](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 1316,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "407f17ecbcaddd70",
      "text": "[✦ (1) 回归系数估计的输出结果如下:](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 1736,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "4a7a6528567cef09",
      "text": "[✦ (2) 线性关系显著性检验的输出结果如下:](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 2156,
      "y": 76
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 78,
      "id": "1ac426e87294a839",
      "text": "[✦ （3）决定系数和调整的决定系数的输出结果如下：](../../../../%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/%E7%94%A8%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8BPM2.5%E6%B5%93%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1.md)",
      "type": "text",
